      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "584CCA84E90DCB02",
      "text": "我來報告一下在[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳外出期間，\\n聯盟社發生了哪些事情。[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
