    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "584CC984E90DC94F",
      "text": "首先……為了防止混亂，\\n我們將藍莓聯盟的排名\\r\\n暫時全部凍結了！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "584CC884E90DC79C",
      "text": "另外也正式追加了\\n留學生可以成為冠軍的規則！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
