      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "584CC584E90DC283",
      "text": "……啊！對不起！我的說法\\n也許聽起來是要[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳感謝我們。[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
