      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "584CD384E90DDA4D",
      "text": "……開會的時候，杜若他一如往常地\\n在、睡、覺、就、是、了！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
