    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_battleend_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "5566182AA64E4875",
      "text": "今天也吸收到了好～多可愛，\\n我非常滿足了！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
