      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "F901F910E7811C71",
      "text": "杜若他啊，\\n為什麼就是那麼吊兒郎當的呢？\\c\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也說說他吧。[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
