    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_fairy_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "F901F810E7811ABE",
      "text": "烏栗他改變造型之後\\n雖然性格變了，\\r\\n但外表看起來很可愛……對不對？[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
